    "title": "What If Your Wedding Ended With A Whataburger Bar - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By JP ,\n4 hours ago\nWhat is more Texas than ending a wedding with a Whataburger burger bar? I can’t think of much else. As a private DJ, I have seen many different ways to close out weddings – a taco bar, a ramen noodle bar, and even menudo, but I haven’t seen a Whataburger bar until now. However, I have seen a Whataburger wedding cake before. I need to find that video. Closing out your wedding with a Whataburger bar. A video posted to TikTok shows a customized Whataburger cart specially made for the bride and groom. The cart is appropriately named What-a-Wedding, and a wedding coordinator and staff can be seen stocking it full of Whatburgers for the guests to enjoy. My question now becomes, “can you customize the Whataburger cart with the Patty Melts?” This is definitely something that guests will be talking about. Congratulations Nadine and Nabih. @whygeelarin Hire a content creator that catches every single detail of your wedding day! #houstoncontentcreator #whatawedding #weddingtok #weddingcontentcreator @Whataburger ♬ TEXAS HOLD ‘EM – Beyoncé I didn’t know if Whataburger catered the wedding. Although, Whataburger does offer special boxes you can order, and they can also deliver your catering order. Check out the details at the Whataburger menu website. Whataburger make the perfect theme for EVERYTING in Texas. Not only is closing your wedding out with Whataburger a totally Texas thing. So is having a Whataburger photo shoot for your baby! It is safe to say that Whataburger is a way of life in Texas, and these are just a couple of examples! Whataburger makes the perfect theme for EVERYTING in Texas. Not only is closing your wedding out with Whataburger a totally Texas thing, so is having a Whataburger photo shoot for your baby! It is safe to say that Whataburger is a way of life in Texas, and these are just a couple of examples!\n@lilianahinojosa Liliana Hinojosa Photography’s WHAT-A-BABY behind the scenes @Whataburger 🍔🍟 #lilianahinojosaphotography #whatababy #whataburger #behindthescenes #photography #newborn ♬ The Home Depot Beat – The Home Depot Download the KIXS Mobile App Now\n1",
